This is an implementation of a 3D falling drop cases to investigate the formation of Worthington jet.

Two sets of parameters are tested based on experimental result showcased in Splash formation by spherical drops by Liow Jong Leng

Cases that are run:
1. Default 6.4 12.8 and 25.6 cells across the droplet for Jet and nojet case without SGS model
1. KE conserving scheme 6.4 12.8 and 25.6 cells across the droplet for Jet and nojet case with SGS model activated
